# Lockstep session (place notes in the party panel, the mine of Schneeberg): a party on the map beside the mine (a player's saved game from a bug report, kept under local/oracle-saves/dlp-issue2, not in the repository) enters the mine; the leader (Marmun) walks west into the entrance's doorway ("near a door" in his row), opens it (U), goes south and west along the hall, north up the first side passage into the next doorway (the note again), opens it, goes through and north onto the alarm of the dwarves' riddle door: the battle ends, the door's card; E (the right knob), the dwarf's card, past him: the next level's battle starts (its first view drawn with a member in a doorway). DARKLANDS_PANEL_TRACE (C#) and local/batch/doormsg/measure/panel_lockstep.py (original) log each row drawn
